sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Atk as Attacker
    participant Src as Untrusted content<br/>(README, issue, web page)
    actor Dev as You
    participant Agent as AI agent
    participant Sys as Your machine<br/>(files, shell, network)
    Atk->>Src: Plant hidden instructions
    Dev->>Agent: "Summarize this repo"
    Agent->>Src: Fetch content
    Src-->>Agent: Content + hidden instructions
    Agent->>Sys: Read ~/.ssh, .env, tokens
    Agent->>Atk: Send data out
